Subject: [PATCH] chore: regenerate patches and update all 10 feature docs
 after review

- Regenerate atomic patches and full diff from current ai-team state
- Doc 01: add 28 missing files (config schema, embedded plugins, plugin
  runtime surfaces), fix channel-resolution.ts description and line refs
- Doc 02: remove stale MCP HTTP bridge section (not in this commit),
  expand session-archive.fs.ts, add test files, add commit 12 fix note
- Doc 03: add 19 missing files (cron run, host-read, symlink, system-prompt),
  fix shouldUseImagePreAnalysis and classifyFailoverReason pseudocode
- Doc 04: replace "code missing" warning with actual locations in
  cli-runner sub-modules, add 6 missing files, add commit 12 fix note
- Doc 05: add 5 missing production files, fix 3 wrong line numbers,
  add auto-rotation reset hooks documentation
- Doc 06: add 9 missing files, add ChannelData/botOpenIdsByAccount/
  bound thread session, fix line range 528-601 -> 585-606
- Doc 07: fix 11 line number offsets in streaming-card.ts and
  reply-dispatcher.ts, add discard()/getMessageId() methods
- Doc 08: add 3 test files, fix text+media pseudocode, add exports
- Doc 09: add 5 missing helper functions to reference table
- Doc 10: fix diagnostic type count 14->13, add guardrail structure

