+++// ---------- MCP loopback HTTP server ----------
+++
+++/**
+++ * Start a plain HTTP server on 127.0.0.1 dedicated to the MCP endpoint.
+++ *
+++ * Implements MCP Streamable HTTP transport (stateless mode) with plain
