++From 809f3dc110a5119b36a4724c2ad5eb39d6ca0adf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
++From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
++Date: Sat, 7 Mar 2026 02:01:11 +0800
++Subject: [PATCH 12/98] feat(plugins): support embedded plugins from Bun
++ compiled binary
++
++Add infrastructure for loading plugins embedded in Bun-compiled binaries:
++- manifest-registry: inject embedded plugin manifests from globalThis.__OPENCLAW_EMBEDDED_PLUGINS__
++- loader: unshift embedded candidates for precedence over disk, load modules from memory (skip file I/O)
++- loader: bypass jiti in Bun runtime (use require() directly since jiti's babel.cjs fails in virtual FS)
++
++When DEBUG_EXTENSIONS=1, bun-entry.ts skips setting __OPENCLAW_EMBEDDED_PLUGINS__,
++so disk-based plugins load normally as fallback.
++
++Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
