++/**
++ * In-memory LRU cache (process lifetime). Key = file path, value = { hash, compacted }.
++ * Avoids redundant LLM calls when file content hasn't changed.
++ * Capped at MAX_CACHE_ENTRIES to prevent unbounded memory growth.
