++Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
++
++HTTP 400 with "Internal server error" body (e.g. from OpenAI proxies) was
++not matched by any failover pattern — classifyFailoverReason returned null,
++preventing model fallback. Add a catch-all text check after the JSON-specific
++isJsonApiInternalServerError so bare occurrences also trigger failover.
