++From a807b00d252ca41a44ee359306fecd1ff6a96abe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
++From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
++Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 09:27:40 +0800
++Subject: [PATCH 30/98] fix(feishu): replace streaming card content instead of
++ merging to prevent duplication
++MIME-Version: 1.0
++Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
++Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
++
++flushStreamingCardUpdate and queueStreamingRender both produce complete
++content snapshots (reasoning blockquote / status line + answer), but
++streaming.update() merged them via mergeStreamingText which concatenated
++incompatible formats — causing Thinking blocks and tool status lines to
++accumulate instead of replacing each other.
++
++Add { replace: true } option to FeishuStreamingSession.update() that
++bypasses mergeStreamingText, and use it for both update paths in the
++reply dispatcher.
++
